  "sourcePatchId": "85e7b068-2337-4992-a6c9-dd1513ba9739",
  "name": "Mycelium Stepped Bubbles",
  "description": "Deterministic stepped pitch/filter motion makes burbling alien sequences from held notes. Two unsynchronized LFOs produce the step pattern; repeatable, not random. MIDI 36\u201376. Built-in filtered echoes and reverb; no global FX needed. Velocity-sensitive, polyphonic, three per-instance controls read on new notes. Route Stereo Output through the mixer to Master.",
